<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>If — Poem Excerpt</title>
<script type="text/javascript" id="MathJax-script" async
  src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
<style>
  body {
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .poem-container {
    max-width: 480px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .poem-line {
    color: #a9c99a;
    font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 2.6;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="poem-container">
    <p class="poem-line">If you can keep your head when all about you</p>
    <p class="poem-line">Are losing theirs and blaming it on you,</p>
    <p class="poem-line">If you can trust yourself when all men doubt you,</p>
    <p class="poem-line">But make allowance for their doubting too;</p>
    <p class="poem-line">If you can wait and not be tired by waiting,</p>
    <p class="poem-line">Or being lied about, don&rsquo;t deal in lies,</p>
    <p class="poem-line">Or being hated, don&rsquo;t give way to hating,</p>
    <p class="poem-line">And yet don&rsquo;t look too good, nor talk too wise:</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
